 make it three. In stoppage time, at 90+1 minutes, Robin Hack capitalized on a defensive lapse by Leon Avdullahu to seal the rout, with Elvedi providing his second assist of the afternoon. In front of 53,033 fans, M'gladbach confirmed a gala performance, clinical in punishing their opponent's mistakes."
